+// Bits: 1 = Vendetta x RCX_VEN_PCT/100, 2 = Marcella and Heart x RCX_MAH_PCT/100, 4 = Vesper x RCX_VES_PCT/100, 8 = RCY_K replaced by RCX_K_V.
